/* ==========================================================================
 * EXOS Game SDK V28: UNIVERSAL GAME WORKSPACE + HARD-PROBLEM SOLVERS
 * --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * V28 is the integration layer rather than another feature pile.
 * It provides one small "workspace" contract that composes the lower-level
 * EXOS systems, plus missing production-grade primitives that engine users
 * routinely rebuild around Phaser/Pixi/Cocos/Kaplay/Excalibur and retro SDKs.
 *
 * Console profiles are planning/validation abstractions in the browser. They
 * intentionally do not claim access to real console registers or timing.
 * ========================================================================== */
