/* ============================================================================
 * EXOS Game SDK V30: universal developer workflow / pain-killer layer
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * V30 intentionally does not replace earlier APIs. It makes the large
 * denominator practical for day-to-day game production:
 *   - DevSession      : breadcrumbs + assertions + checkpoints + counters
 *   - CommandHistory  : execute/undo/redo + transactions for tools/gameplay
 *   - AssetLoader     : async dedupe/cache/retry/dependency loading
 *   - RenderCache     : explicit command-cache with invalidation statistics
 *   - ProjectConfig   : one source of truth for environment/build toggles
 *   - CompatProfile   : semantic migration map for Phaser/Pixi/Cocos/Kaplay/
 *                       Excalibur and retro-console concepts
 *   - Diagnostics     : one-call cross-system health report and CI gate
 *
 * These are deliberately ES5-friendly and remain platform-neutral.  The
 * browser runtime is still the execution backend; retro targets are modeled
 * as constraints/planning contracts, not fake native console drivers.
 * ========================================================================== */
