/* ==========================================================================
 * EXOS Game SDK V37 / UNIVERSAL 2D DEVELOPER + PRODUCTION HARDENING
 * --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * V37 is an additive developer-experience layer on top of V36.
 *
 * Design goals:
 *   - Make common game-development jobs one or two API calls.
 *   - Turn "mysterious runtime bugs" into inspectable diagnostics.
 *   - Treat async cancellation, asset contracts, save migrations and input
 *     contexts as first-class runtime concepts.
 *   - Provide an engine-neutral rendering / simulation seam.
 *   - Model retro-console constraints as validation budgets, never vendor
 *     SDK/source compatibility.
 * ========================================================================== */
